      "writtenOn": "2022-10-19T16:51:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Although there is precedent for this in the existing state machines, in general, I don\u0027t think we should be writing tests that explicitly set or check the state of the state machines. The tests should be based on the traffic we generate. I\u0027d make these internal functions straightforwardly static and wait for there to be a compelling reason to change that.",
